{"model":"gemma4:e4b","created_at":"2026-04-13T23:14:29.5468687Z","response":"**?렓 The Ultimate Prompt (Ready to Use):**\n\n**Genre/Style:** A hyperdetailed masterpiece oil painting, executed in the style of Impressionism (late 19th-century master artists like Degas or Renoir). The paint texture must be visible and tactile, showcasing deliberate, visible brushstrokes on canvas, combined with a high-end, cinematic digital polish.\n\n**Scene Composition:** A wide, moody shot taken from inside the cozy, dimly lit interior of a vintage Parisian caf챕. The view is framed through a rain-streaked window.\n\n**Subject:** The central focus is the dark, solitary silhouette of a lonesome traveler (early 30s, wearing a heavy, vintage brown wool trench coat). This figure is positioned looking outward, partially obscured by the cafe's depth of field. Outside, the street is wet, and the background features blurred, mysterious, passing figures?봥hostly, indistinct forms caught in the downpour.\n\n**Lighting \u0026 Atmosphere:** Extreme dual-tone contrast is essential. The interior glows with deep, inviting **Warm Amber** light (emanating from lamps, lanterns, or Edison bulbs). This contrast violently clashes with the cold, bluish **Cool Cyan** glow of the streetlights and the rainy atmosphere outside. Raindrops bead and cascade heavily across the window glass, distorting the outdoor view.\n\n**Technical Elements:** Emphasize a soft, dreamy **bokeh** effect in the background, lending a hazy, mysterious quality to the distant lights. Integrate subtle **film grain** and a deep, cinematic depth of field (shallow DoF), making the interior warm and the exterior cold and ephemeral.\n\n---\n**?뱴 Suggested Keywords/Negative Prompts (For best results):**\n\n*   **Keywords:** Oil painting, Impressionism, Impressionist style, Masterpiece, Cinematic lighting, Dual-tone, Cyan and Amber, Silhouette, Bokeh, Film grain, Rainy street, Parisian cafe, Moody, Noir, Visible brushstrokes, Depth of field.\n